To the list:

I recently downloaded the  Alpha Core 10 3-disk set from  .zero42.  Did a text
upgrade install on my XP1000, plus the recommended changes to aboot.conf. It
would not boot, many "failed" messages flashing by too fast to read.

I tried a new install, text, same mods to aboot.conf. Same result.  I mounted
